                        <li><strong>Opéra :</strong> <a href="http://help.opera.com" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">http://help.opera.com</a></li>
                    </ul>

                    <p class="leading-relaxed text-sm bg-indigo-50/50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-indigo-100">
